Advance COP0 Count from the existing shared EE cycle clock; guest writes retain a global offset.
Count is an EE processor-cycle counter, not per-thread saved state.
Reference behavior: https://github.com/PCSX2/pcsx2/blob/master/pcsx2/R5900.cpp

